---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---
<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: '글 관리', description: '작성자 전용 글 관리', tableOfContents: false, pagefind: false }}>
  <div id="blog-admin" class="admin-view" data-pagefind-ignore>
    <p id="admin-status" role="status">로그인 상태를 확인하고 있습니다.</p>
    <div id="admin-login" hidden>
      <p>작성자 계정으로 로그인하면 글을 작성하고 수정할 수 있습니다.</p>
      <a id="admin-login-link" class="admin-button" href="#">GitHub으로 로그인</a>
    </div>
    <div id="admin-workspace" hidden>
      <div class="admin-toolbar">
        <span id="admin-account"></span>
        <button id="new-post" type="button">새 글 작성</button>
        <button id="refresh-posts" type="button">목록 새로고침</button>
        <button id="admin-logout" type="button">로그아웃</button>
      </div>
      <div id="admin-posts" class="admin-posts" aria-label="내 글 목록"></div>
      <form id="post-editor" hidden>
        <div class="editor-heading">
          <h2 id="editor-heading">새 글 작성</h2>
          <button id="close-editor" type="button">닫기</button>
        </div>
        <label>제목<input id="post-title" name="title" required maxlength="200" /></label>
        <label>짧은 소개<textarea id="post-description" name="description" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
        <div class="editor-grid">
          <label>카테고리<select id="post-category" name="category"><option value="development">개발</option><option value="til">TIL</option><option value="life">일상·회고</option></select></label>
          <label>글 주소<input id="post-slug" name="slug" required pattern="[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*" placeholder="my-first-note" /></label>
          <label>발행일<input id="post-date" name="date" type="date" required /></label>
          <label>태그<input id="post-tags" name="tags" placeholder="JavaScript, 기록" /></label>
        </div>
        <p id="post-address" class="editor-note"></p>
        <div class="editor-options">
          <label><input id="post-draft" name="draft" type="checkbox" checked />초안으로 저장</label>
          <label><input id="post-comments" name="comments" type="checkbox" checked />댓글·좋아요 허용</label>
        </div>
        <p class="editor-note">초안은 블로그에 표시되지 않습니다. 원본 파일은 공개 GitHub 저장소에 저장됩니다.</p>
        <div class="editor-tabs">
          <button id="show-writing" type="button" aria-pressed="true">본문 작성</button>
          <button id="show-preview" type="button" aria-pressed="false">미리보기</button>
        </div>
        <div id="writing-tools" class="writing-tools" role="toolbar" aria-label="Markdown 도구">
          <button type="button" data-markdown="heading">제목</button>
          <button type="button" data-markdown="bold">굵게</button>
          <button type="button" data-markdown="link">링크</button>
          <button type="button" data-markdown="code">코드 블록</button>
          <button id="attach-image" type="button">이미지 첨부</button>
          <input id="image-files" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp" multiple hidden />
        </div>
        <p class="editor-note">Markdown으로 작성하세요. # 제목, **굵게**, 목록, 코드 블록을 미리보기에서 확인할 수 있습니다. 이미지는 본문에 붙여넣거나 끌어놓으세요. PNG·JPG·GIF·WebP, 파일당 최대 5MB.</p>
        <label id="body-label" class="body-label">본문<textarea id="post-body" name="body" rows="18" placeholder="## 오늘 배운 것&#10;&#10;Markdown으로 작성하고 이미지를 붙여넣어 보세요."></textarea></label>
        <div id="post-preview" class="sl-markdown-content editor-preview" hidden></div>
        <div id="attached-images" class="attached-images" aria-label="첨부 이미지" hidden></div>
        <p id="image-status" class="editor-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p id="mdx-note" class="editor-note" hidden>MDX 글의 컴포넌트는 배포된 화면에서 확인할 수 있습니다. 여기서는 Markdown 본문을 미리 봅니다.</p>
        <div class="editor-actions">
          <button id="save-post" class="primary" type="submit">초안 저장</button>
          <button id="delete-post" class="danger" type="button" hidden>글 삭제</button>
        </div>
        <p id="save-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
    <dialog id="editor-confirm" aria-labelledby="confirm-heading">
      <h2 id="confirm-heading">확인</h2>
      <p id="confirm-message"></p>
      <form method="dialog" class="editor-actions">
        <button value="cancel" autofocus>취소</button>
        <button id="confirm-accept" value="accept" class="primary">계속</button>
      </form>
    </dialog>
  </div>
</StarlightPage>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/admin-editor';
</script>
<style is:global>
  .admin-view [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .admin-view button, .admin-button { padding: .5rem .9rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: .4rem; background: var(--sl-color-bg); color: var(--sl-color-white); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: .875rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .admin-view button:hover, .admin-button:hover { border-color: var(--sl-color-accent); }
  .admin-view button:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: wait; }
  .admin-view .primary, .admin-button { background: var(--sl-color-text-accent); color: var(--sl-color-bg); border-color: transparent; }
  .admin-view .danger { color: var(--sl-color-red-high); }
  .admin-toolbar, .editor-heading, .editor-actions, .editor-tabs { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .editor-heading { justify-content: space-between; }
  .admin-posts { margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline); }
  .admin-post-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline); }
  .admin-post-row strong { display: block; font-size: 1rem; }
  .admin-post-row small { color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .admin-post-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; flex: none; font-size: .875rem; }
  .admin-view label { display: block; margin: 1rem 0; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .admin-view input:not([type=checkbox]), .admin-view select, .admin-view textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: .4rem; padding: .65rem .75rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: .4rem; background: var(--sl-color-bg); color: var(--sl-color-white); font: inherit; font-weight: normal; }
  .admin-view input:disabled, .admin-view select:disabled { opacity: .7; }
  .admin-view textarea { resize: vertical; }
  .admin-view :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-text-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .editor-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: 1rem; }
  .editor-options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .editor-options label { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
  .admin-view .editor-note { color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .admin-view .body-label { font-size: 0; }
  .admin-view #post-body { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .editor-tabs [aria-pressed=true] { border-color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .editor-preview { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: .4rem; min-height: 22rem; }
  .writing-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }
  .writing-tools button { padding: .35rem .6rem; }
  .attached-images { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .attached-images figure { margin: 0; max-width: 10rem; }
  .attached-images img { display: block; max-width: 10rem; height: 7rem; object-fit: contain; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: .4rem; }
  .attached-images figcaption { font-size: .75rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .editor-preview img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .admin-view dialog { max-width: 30rem; width: calc(100% - 2rem); padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: .6rem; background: var(--sl-color-bg); color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .admin-view dialog::backdrop { background: #0008; }
  .admin-view dialog h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .admin-view dialog .editor-actions { justify-content: flex-end; margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 35rem) { .editor-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .admin-post-row { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
